Hi Andreas,
how about something along the following lines:

ggplot() +
  geom_text(data=ppp[1:2,], aes(x=f, y=n, label=v), hjust=1) +
  geom_text(data=ppp[3:4,], aes(x=f, y=n, label=v), hjust=0) +
  scale_x_discrete(expand=c(2,0))

By the way, I renamed the variables of your data frame just to avoid visual collisions with some reserved keywords.

Best Regards,
Marco.

